ign="center"><p>长大的秘密一：身体变高了</p></content></shape><img id="bdF" src="GgIHbrDyiopqoqx6rcMcV860nfc" width="400" height="400" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="0" bottomOffset="0"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="460" type="text" id="bdD"><content fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>小朋友们，量一量，你比小时候长高了多少呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bdz"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWn"><style><fill id="fWn"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bdS"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(237, 125, 49, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的秘密二：手脚变大了</p></content></shape><img id="bdi" src="AeIMbcWMKoCgrVxTS81csNlmngd" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bdC"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>看看你的小手小脚丫，是不是比小时候大很多呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bdm"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWM"><style><fill id="fWM"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bdA"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(237, 125, 49, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的秘密三：开始换牙了</p></content></shape><img id="bdp" src="Zh4JbiUXqoihPGx4nRMccxthnz2" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bdX"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你有没有掉过牙齿？换牙说明你正在长大哦！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bdo"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWI"><style><fill id="fWI"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bdP"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(72, 145, 206, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>想一想：你的身体还有什么变化？</p></content></shape><img id="bdv" src="JKQVbYwokoq2zDxCIMvc1oJRn1T" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bdR"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>和旁边的小朋友说一说，你发现自己哪里长大了？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bdk"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWT"><style><fill id="fWT"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bdf"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领一：自己穿衣服</p></content></shape><img id="bdj" src="IaffbnAj9o2Vr5xA9QRcsgNanCg" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bdT"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你会自己穿衣服、扣扣子吗？真棒！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bdu"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWX"><style><fill id="fWX"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhZ"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领二：自己吃饭</p></content></shape><img id="bhs" src="Osj7bVwPxoKkYXxAtZ8ciO6qnic" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhd"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你会自己用勺子吃饭，不挑食吗？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhh"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWJ"><style><fill id="fWJ"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhe"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领三：自己整理玩具</p></content></shape><img id="bhN" src="CYyLb6YOhoQ0qjxbVP7cpt8gnTf" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhQ"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>玩完玩具后，你会自己收拾好吗？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhB"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWB"><style><fill id="fWB"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhl"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领四：学会画画了</p></content></shape><img id="bhG" src="W9KBbj41ao2erAxDfdzcwwDtn6f" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhw"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你会画什么呢？画给大家看一看吧！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhV"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWC"><style><fill id="fWC"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhb"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领五：会讲故事了</p></content></shape><img id="bhM" src="EulpbtKRYoDr1CxNH66cRJbCn6l" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhn"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你会讲什么故事？讲给小朋友们听一听吧！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhO"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWd"><style><fill id="fWd"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhq"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领六：会拍皮球了</p></content></shape><img id="bhr" src="PUPNbijnuocL9OxFj3GcEBQnnXc" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhg"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你能连续拍多少下皮球呢？试一试吧！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhc"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWp"><style><fill id="fWp"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhx"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(72, 145, 206, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>说一说：你还学会了什么新本领？</p></content></shape><img id="bhW" src="JKQVbYwokoq2zDxCIMvc1oJRn1T" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhK"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>用完整的话说：&quot;我长大了，我会……&quot;</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhy"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWo"><style><fill id="fWo"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhU"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领七：会关心别人</p></content></shape><img id="bha" src="S4ilbDGVgonvphxPzRwcYDhKnUe" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhI"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>当小朋友难过时，你会怎么安慰他呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhL"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWf"><style><fill id="fWf"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhH"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领八：会分享、交朋友</p></content></shape><img id="bht" src="T1ahbXZLmoM7tOxtEgbcOcoxn5c" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhE"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你有好朋友吗？你们一起分享什么呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhY"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWr"><style><fill id="fWr"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhS"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领九：会帮大人做事</p></content></shape><img id="bhi" src="RMoYb1AXToLz1YxZUYCc3Zrxnvd" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhC"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你会帮老师擦桌子、帮妈妈捶背吗？真是能干的好孩子！</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhm"><content><p>【教师指导语】引导幼儿说说自己会帮大人做什么事情，鼓励幼儿用完整的句子表达，如&quot;我会帮老师……&quot;。可以请2-3个小朋友分享，及时给予肯定和表扬。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="pWb"><style><fill id="fWb"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhp"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(112, 173, 71, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>长大的本领十：会看书、认识字</p></content></shape><img id="bhX" src="N0cLb8cC8ozKxsxwINOcA8wlnBE" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bho"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>你认识哪些字宝宝？你喜欢看什么书呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhA"><content><p>【教师指导语】可以出示一些简单的汉字卡片让幼儿认读，或者请幼儿说说自己看过的有趣的绘本故事，培养幼儿的阅读兴趣和表达能力。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="pWZ"><style><fill id="fWZ"><fillColor color="rgba(255, 248, 220, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="800" height="80" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="40" type="text" id="bhF"><content textType="headline" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(255, 192, 0, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="center"><p>小游戏：这样做是长大了吗？</p></content></shape><img id="bhD" src="M4gGb7xufo7gijxr4ymcUm6fn2g" width="400" height="320" topLeftX="280" topLeftY="130"><crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="40" bottomOffset="40"/></img><shape width="800" height="60" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bhz"><content fontSize="22" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(101, 67, 33, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center"><p>左边和右边的小朋友，谁真的长大了呢？</p></content></shape></data><note id="bhJ"><content/></note></slide><slide id="pWS"><style><fill id="fWS"><fillImg src="Bx9BbzptvoOFRFxdqe2cClvRnTh" alpha="1" rotateWithShape="true" stretchLeft="0" stretchBottom="0" stretchRight="0" stretchTop="0"/></fill></style><data><img id="bdq" src="L2e6bRIHdoA8FkxbQCLcbq2Bn3e" width="310.5" height="310.5" topLeftX="43.849527559055105" topLeftY="34.57574803149606"><crop leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="0" bottomOffset="0"/></img><img id="bdy" src="PpLfb6Be7oirU4x8LiHcXG3fnTh" width="227.7840157480315" height="405" topLeftX="378.4357480314961" topLeftY="34.55622047244094"><crop leftOffset="0" 